Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","review_id":"ejo5gRomS6G20g9I5iYmFg","date":"2016-08-17T21:03:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9289217591285706,"text_excerpt":"You're a BRICK, SPOON.. You're mighty mighty just letting us all hang out. Now that, that minor lapse of judgment is over I'll carry on... I came here for a relaxing Sunday brunch with a group of friends. Good thing we intended to have a relaxing brunch bc getting our food was rather slow. However, our waitress was very attentive and the owner even popped by to ask how everything was. We started with some traditional and cinnamon sugar beignets that were crunchy, light and fluffy all at the same time. The cinnamon beignets came with a delicious apple sauce spread that added the perfect touch. I opted for the American breakfast which was very filling and the portion was rather large. The g..."},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","review_id":"SdXJprVmaD1UeiXAr__1ng","date":"2016-06-18T17:35:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9263929128646851,"text_excerpt":"We were referred to this location by a co worker. It was an awesome experience. It was raining and the staff met us at the door with a smile. Alexander gave us exceptional service. He was so helpful and pleasant through our brunch. The food was over the top. Recommend the breakfast tacos. We missed the build our own Bloody Mary. Oh well! Next time."},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","review_id":"pHjhW-iYKM4w3nsYnUyslw","date":"2016-04-06T14:16:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9125620126724243,"text_excerpt":"Some women in my hotel told me I had to try this place - I admit I was a little worried with the Yelp reviews, but I am glad I listened. We went for breakfast and started out with a cold brew and the creole deviled eggs with fried oysters on top - they were incredible. Worth the visit. I also had the shrimp and grits for breakfast. It was good - but not specials like some of the other places I've eaten. But the coffee is amazing and the deviled eggs made it well worth the trip."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","photo_id":"RQercmiAuXSY-_5p8LbkGw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/RQercmiAuXSY-_5p8LbkGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9347859621047974},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","photo_id":"mEZas_kmsv5Gmzwp7yL6wg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mEZas_kmsv5Gmzwp7yL6wg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8572953939437866},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","photo_id":"kUHmzEcdo6C3atG4X8US6Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kUHmzEcdo6C3atG4X8US6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8239316940307617},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","photo_id":"xtaWj70VFuPrmRM6JGlUqw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xtaWj70VFuPrmRM6JGlUqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.804634690284729},{"business_id":"GEfM4uB9j6oIr2_XEaAArQ","photo_id":"R_6KeZkSXh3ylxGwsjhYyg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/R_6KeZkSXh3ylxGwsjhYyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7931598424911499}]},"notebook_case":null}
